 "remarks": "Tucked away at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac in Westport's desirable Charcoal Hill neighborhood, this beautiful one-level ranch offers the perfect blend of comfort, privacy, and easy living. Situated on 2.03 acres bordering a 7-acre land trust preserve, the home provides a peaceful setting with plenty of room to enjoy the outdoors. Thoughtfully updated throughout, the home features 3 bedrooms, 3 full bathrooms, and 2 additional flexible rooms. The bright, open layout includes a beautifully appointed kitchen with Bertazzoni appliances, Marvin windows, Kohler fixtures, and two wood-burning fireplaces. The primary suite opens to a private deck overlooking the property, while a covered deck offers a wonderful space for relaxing or entertaining. The spacious finished walk-out lower level provides additional living space, a full bathroom, and versatile rooms perfect for guests, home offices, or recreation. Additional features include a 2-car garage, high-efficiency HVAC, and smart-home technology. Conveniently located just half a mile from Coleytown schools, with easy access to the Merritt Parkway and downtown Westport. A wonderful opportunity to enjoy comfortable, move-in-ready living in a private and convenient Westport location.",
